<title>UK: Guinness, GrandMet make overtures to LVMH -paper.</title>
<headline>Guinness, GrandMet make overtures to LVMH -paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinness Plc and Grand Metropolitan Plc have made secret overtures to French drinks and luxury goods group LVMH which could open up the way for a three-way merger, the Guardian reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The paper said Grand Met and Guinness -- had signalled they would be willing to hold top-level talks which might open the way for Bernard Arnault's LVMH to become part of their proposed merged operation.</p>
<p>LVMH has a 14.2 percent stake in Guinness and has built up a holding of nearly 6.4 percent in Grand Met.</p>
</text>
